===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|حَمَاس|lit=enthusiasm}}, an acronym for {{m|ar|حَرَكَة اَلْمُقَاوَمَة الْإِسْلَامِيَّة|tr=ḥarakat al-muqāwama l-ʾislāmiyya||Islamic Resistance Movement}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[militant]] [[Palestinianist]] and [[Sunni]] [[Muslim]] movement that presses for an [[independent]], [[Palestinian]] Islamic [[state]] and the Palestinian right of return.

